---
// ZONE 3 — Midnight Zone. The founder, seen through a submersible viewport.
---
<section id="midnight" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-abyss-900">
  <div
    class="absolute top-1/3 left-1/2 h-[500px] w-[500px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-glow-500/[0.06] blur-[140px]"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-28 md:py-40">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-14 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-20">
      <!-- Porthole portrait -->
      <div class="reveal order-2 md:order-1">
        <div class="relative mx-auto h-72 w-72 md:h-96 md:w-96">
          <div class="absolute -inset-4 rounded-full border border-white/12" aria-hidden="true">
          </div>
          <div class="absolute -inset-9 rounded-full border border-white/[0.05]" aria-hidden="true">
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full border-[6px] border-[#16283a] shadow-[0_0_90px_rgba(79,227,193,0.14)]"
          >
            <img
              src="/images/supian.webp"
              alt="Supian M., founder of Octopy"
              class="h-full w-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div
              class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full shadow-[inset_0_0_70px_24px_rgba(1,3,10,0.85)]"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
            </div>
          </div>
          <p
            class="absolute -bottom-12 left-1/2 w-max -translate-x-1/2 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] text-white/40 uppercase"
          >
            Supian M. &middot; Founder
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bio -->
      <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
        <p class="reveal font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-glow-300/70 uppercase">
          &minus;1,000 m &middot; Midnight Zone
        </p>
        <h2
          class="reveal mt-6 font-display text-4xl leading-tight font-medium tracking-tight text-foam-50 md:text-5xl"
          style="--reveal-delay: 90ms"
        >
          The human behind<br />the <em class="font-light text-glow-300">studio.</em>
        </h2>
        <div
          class="reveal mt-6 space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-foam-100/60"
          style="--reveal-delay: 180ms"
        >
          <p>
            I&rsquo;m Supian M. &mdash; a software and Linux systems engineer. For the past decade
            I&rsquo;ve worked where code meets infrastructure: building web applications and
            running the servers underneath them, for government agencies and private clients
            alike.
          </p>
          <p>
            My work ships as reliable, production-ready systems. No over-engineering, no theater.
          </p>
        </div>

        <ul class="reveal mt-9 space-y-5" style="--reveal-delay: 260ms">
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <i class="ph-duotone ph-stack mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-2xl text-glow-300"></i>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-foam-50">Full-lifecycle ownership</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foam-100/55">
                From bare-metal Linux, WAFs and mail servers to backend APIs and frontends.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <i class="ph-duotone ph-scales mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-2xl text-glow-300"></i>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-foam-50">Pragmatic architecture</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foam-100/55">
                Cost-effective, maintainable stacks that survive contact with production.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <i class="ph-duotone ph-code mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-2xl text-glow-300"></i>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-foam-50">Open source at scale</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foam-100/55">
                Libraries I author and maintain run in production for teams worldwide.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p
          class="reveal mt-9 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-xs text-foam-100/60"
          style="--reveal-delay: 320ms"
        >
          <i class="ph-duotone ph-map-pin text-base text-glow-300"></i>
          Indonesia &mdash; working worldwide
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
